2016b584a444580cf.poster.avif?t=1719713949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/df91a342bf780e12016b584a444580cf.webm?t=1719713949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/df91a342bf780e12016b584a444580cf.mp4?t=1719713949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Soundodger+ combines the twitchiness of bullet hell shooters with the sonic thrills of rhythm games to create a wholly unique experience. Take on multiple difficulties for virtually every track, each level hand-choreographed to sync to the music every time. Push your skills even further to collect the hidden hearts for some extra insurance against tougher sections. Carry them all the way to the end to unlock extra tracks and modes. And when you've mastered everything there is to dodge, craft your own masterpiece in the Level Editor or check out the hundreds of community levels made over the last decade to see what it really means to play an &quot;impossible&quot; level.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/ead43dc1bc634d80aceeeb1b15c4f050.poster.avif?t=1719713949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/ead43dc1bc634d80aceeeb1b15c4f050.webm?t=1719713949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/ead43dc1bc634d80aceeeb1b15c4f050.mp4?t=1719713949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Weave your way through the beauty and challenge of levels choreographed to <strong>over 20 tracks</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Keep the party going with <strong>over 30 additional DLC levels</strong> (included in game)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Artists include celebrated game musicians <strong>Disasterpeace</strong> (FEZ, Runner2), <strong>Danny Baranowsky</strong> (The Binding of Isaac, Crypt of the Necrodancer), <strong>Austin Wintory</strong> (Journey, The Banner Saga), and many others<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Jump right into the action with <strong>Auto-Gen</strong> to instantly play a level based on your own music<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Flex those creative muscles in the robust <strong>Level Editor</strong> to hand-craft the level of your dreams<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Take a breather with your <strong>Slo-Mo power</strong>, or play in <strong>Zen mode</strong> where the points don't matter<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Stay locked in and never interrupt the music with <strong>Smooth Listening mode</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Move at your own speed with <strong>mouse controls</strong>, or try your hand at keyboard/controller for an unintentional difficulty spike<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/2143a81172213ccd85098d5c10c4dd03.poster.avif?t=1719713949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/2143a81172213ccd85098d5c10c4dd03.webm?t=1719713949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/2143a81172213ccd85098d5c10c4dd03.mp4?t=1719713949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full Track List (Main Game)</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Anoctave - Frog of Lore<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Austin Wintory - Lost Age<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Bean - Senioritis<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Bean - Sixteen &amp; Dangerous<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Bean - Solvalou<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247140/extras/6230d45ed801506e36ccace3d745686b.webp?t=1719713949\" /></div> Bill Kiley - Foxtail Socks<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" s